                            "last_played": 1544849773
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I have played tons of TD games (3 Kingdom rush, Dungeon Warfare, Plants vs. Zombies,.....)\nThis is game is awful for the following reasons:\n-No tutorial given at all\n-No info about what tower stats are\n-No information about enemies and their strengths and weaknesses \n-Get ready to fail the hard missions multiple times\n-The game is stingy at the beginning of every level. Not enough crystals given to get good towers\n-Rather than adding more levels the developer chose to make the game harder by making you play the SAME levels on 3 difficulty levels\n-Super powers do not recharge fast enough",
